# Entries have a mood (1-5), an optional time of day and an optional note.
# Everything is stored in plain CSV files in ~/.local/share/moodlog/
#   moods.csv   date,time,mood,note   (several entries a day are allowed)
#   events.csv  date,kind,title,note   (important events, e.g. a medication change)
#   health.csv  date,metric,value   (optional, sent by your phone: see Phone sync)
